      "doc": "Suspend an address \\xe2\\x80\\x94 temporarily prevents protocol usage without\\ndestroying the KYC attestation. The user's provider data is\\npreserved; when unsuspended the user resumes as verified. For\\nregulatory reviews, investigations, or temporary risk-management\\nholds.",
      "name": "suspend_account",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "admin",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
